          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14]</span><br/>In the equation above, what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14]\nIn the equation above, what is the value of [MATH: v?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14]</span> and are asked to solve for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v.]</span></p><p>Let&#x27;s solve the equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2v)/(5)|= 14; 2v|= 14 \u22c5 5; 2v|= 70; v|= (70)/(2); v|= 35]</span></p><p>So, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: v]</span> that satisfies the equation is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 35.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14] and are asked to solve for [MATH: v.]\n\nLet's solve the equation for [MATH: v{:}]\n\n[MATH: (2v)/(5)|= 14; 2v|= 14 \u22c5 5; 2v|= 70; v|= (70)/(2); v|= 35]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: v] that satisfies the equation is [MATH: 35.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14]\nIn the equation above, what is the value of [MATH: v?]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given the equation [MATH: \\dfrac{2v}{5} = 14] and are asked to solve for [MATH: v.]\n\nLet's solve the equation for [MATH: v{:}]\n\n[MATH: (2v)/(5)|= 14; 2v|= 14 \u22c5 5; 2v|= 70; v|= (70)/(2); v|= 35]\n\nSo, the value of [MATH: v] that satisfies the equation is [MATH: 35.]"
      },
