        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8x]</span> given that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: 8x] given that [MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8x.]</span></p><p>First, we solve the equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: (5)/(8)x \u2212 1|= 9; (5)/(8)x|= 9 + 1; (5)/(8)x|= 10; 5x|= 80; x|= (80)/(5); x|= 16]</span></p><p>Now, we substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x = 16]</span> into <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8x{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8x|= 8 \u22c5 16; = 128]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 8x.]\n\nFirst, we solve the equation for [MATH: x{:}]\n[MATH: (5)/(8)x \u2212 1|= 9; (5)/(8)x|= 9 + 1; (5)/(8)x|= 10; 5x|= 80; x|= (80)/(5); x|= 16]\n\nNow, we substitute [MATH: x = 16] into [MATH: 8x{:}]\n[MATH: 8x|= 8 \u22c5 16; = 128]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: 8x] given that [MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe are given the equation [MATH: \\dfrac{5}{8}x - 1 = 9] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 8x.]\n\nFirst, we solve the equation for [MATH: x{:}]\n[MATH: (5)/(8)x \u2212 1|= 9; (5)/(8)x|= 9 + 1; (5)/(8)x|= 10; 5x|= 80; x|= (80)/(5); x|= 16]\n\nNow, we substitute [MATH: x = 16] into [MATH: 8x{:}]\n[MATH: 8x|= 8 \u22c5 16; = 128]"
      },
